    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 13th level, you are able to hone your sight and focus it upon a creature that you have seen before. By performing a 10 minute ritual, you can attempt to cast the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.fVbCxFRaORalHB20]{scrying} spell without providing material components. Roll a percentile dice, if the result is less than your Shaman level, you cast the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells.Item.fVbCxFRaORalHB20]{scrying} spell.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>",
